<title>UK: McDonnell Info to raise 24.3 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>McDonnell Info to raise 24.3 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's McDonnell Information Systems Plc, which restored its share listing on Friday, said it was planning to raise 24.3 million stg by an placing and open offer of 104.79 million shares at 26 pence each.</p>
</text>
